WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:08,330
Take the order and I can help you move a lot of supplies at once

2
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:10,330
Just find a convenience store that hasn't been raided

3
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:12,330
I can bring back all the useful things inside

4
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:21,110
My sun can be called a sac belt

5
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:22,110
Things enter an independent space

6
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:24,110
Won't stick to anything

7
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,400
You go out with me

8
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,400
Others stayed at the hotel to restore their systems
